Gohan da yo! Da da da dan!

00:23:11.460 --> 00:23:13.960
Time for an isekai preview from us reincarnated slimes!

00:23:14.500 --> 00:23:16.380
Next time our heroes find themselves...

00:23:16.380 --> 00:23:18.420
...in a most frightening of locales.

00:23:18.420 --> 00:23:19.210
