00:23:25.250 --> 00:23:26.710
But don't worry!

00:23:26.710 --> 00:23:29.210
We have the great Yuji by our side!

00:23:29.210 --> 00:23:31.080
That's right! We're...

00:23:31.460 --> 00:23:40.880
<b>INFILTRATING AN OMINOUS VILLAGE</b>

00:23:31.580 --> 00:23:33.880
...infiltrating an ominous village!

00:23:33.960 --> 00:23:36.000
Whether we'll make it out in one blob...

00:23:36.000 --> 00:23:37.380
...none of us yet know!

00:23:37.380 --> 00:23:38.330
Oh no!
